<title>RUSSIA: Russian Rosgosstrakh 96 premiums up to 3 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russian Rosgosstrakh 96 premiums up to 3 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>			     1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Premiums	     3.09 trln rbls   2.70 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Claims paid	  1.71 trln	  1.50 trln</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name OAO Rosgosstrakh. 1996 figures are preliminary to Russian accounting standards.</p>
<p>The company is Russia's biggest insurance company, dedicated mainly to policies for the individual.</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
